'''Team Pigeons''' was an organization-less [[:Category:Europe|European]] women's ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team. It was initially formed after [[Nigma Galaxy]] parted ways with their team. Its second iteration was formed after [[Imperial Female]] released their team.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2026
|This=2
|content1=
