* May 25th - '''Team Pigeons''' are signed by [[Imperial Esports]], becoming [[Imperial Female]]. <ref name="imperial pigeons">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/imperialesports/status/1794408181319250139|title=É hora de expandir nosso território!|trans_title=It’s time to expand our territory!|language={{Flag|br}} Portugese|date=2024-05-25|author=[[Imperial Esports]]}}</ref>
|content2=
