* March 4th - [[wieenN-]] steps down from '''Team Pigeons'''. <ref name="-wieenn">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/athena_cup/status/2029337973100081297|title=@wieenn7 has left the Pigeons roster|date=2026-03-04|author=[[Athena CS]]}}</ref>
* April 2nd - '''Team Pigeons''' are signed by [[Clutchain]], becoming [[Clutchain Female]]. <ref name="clutch">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/clutchain/status/2039686092631244847|title=We're not just building an app. We're building a team|date=2026-04-02|author=[[Clutchain]]}}</ref>
