'''Team Spirit Academy''' is the academy team of [[Team Spirit]], a [[:Category:Russia|Russian]] esports organization headquartered in [[:wikipedia:Belgrade|Belgrade]], [[:Category:Serbia|Serbia]] since 2022.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2017
|name2=2021
|name3=2022
|name4=2023
|name5=2024
|name6=2025
|name7=2026
|This=7

|content1=
* May 9th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' is formed with the acquirement of [[Team1337]]. <ref name="AC 2017">{{cite web|url=http://teamspirit.ru/team-spirit-academy|date=2017-05-09|title=Team Spirit открывает академию|language= {{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title= Team Spirit sign academy team|publisher=[[Team Spirit]]}}</ref>
* September 10th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' bench [[BAS]] and [[NickelBack]]. <ref name="BAS and NickelBack bench">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-147106745_1074|date=2017-09-10|title=Вот и нас они не обошли стороной, в команде грядут перемены, а сейчас на скамейку запасных отправляются NickelBack и BAS:|trans_title=Our team have changes, now we benched NickelBack and BAS|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|author=[[Team Spirit]]}}</ref>
* November 1st - [[NickelBack]] is acquired by [[Elements Pro Gaming]]. <ref name="-NickelBack">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-108293294_136847|date=2017-11-01|title=Организация Elements Pro Gaming объявляет о полной укомплектации CS:GO состава!|trans_title=Elements Pro Gaming announce a new full line-up|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|author=[[Elements Pro Gaming]]}}</ref>
* December 11th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' part ways with their roster. <ref name="-AC 2017">{{cite web|url=http://teamspirit.ru/team-spirit-says-farewell-to-academy/|date=2017-12-11|title=Team Spirit расстается с Академией|language= {{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Team Spirit parted with the Academy|publisher=[[Team Spirit]]}}</ref>

|content2=
*March 28th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' sign a new lineup consisting of [[Patsi]], [[T4RG3T]], [[znxxX]], [[s1ren]], [[zont1x]], [[God6y]], and [[hally]] as the head coach. <ref name="AC 2021">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/@team_spirit-predstavlyaem-team-spirit-academy|title=Team Spirit Academy|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|author=[[Team Spirit]]|date=2021-03-28}}</ref>
*April 20th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' sign [[FL4MUS]]. <ref name="+FL4MUS">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1428771350144077830|title=He was on the team from 20.04.2021 to 05.08.2021|date=2021-08-20|author=[[Team Spirit]]}}</ref>
*July 24th - [[hally]] and [[S0tF1k]] from [[Team Spirit]] switch positions on their respective teams. <ref name="hally and S0t switch">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/@team_spirit-perestanovki-v-trenerskom-shtabe-spirit-csgo|title=Перестановки в тренерском штабе Spirit CS:GO|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Rearrangements in the coaching headquarters of Spirit CS:GO|author=[[Team Spirit]]|date=2021-07-24}}</ref>
*August 20th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' part ways with [[T4RG3T]] and [[FL4MUS]]. <ref name="-FL4MUS -T4RG3T">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1428755446731509766|title=Changes in the Spirit Academy squad|date=2021-08-20|author=[[Team Spirit]]}}</ref>
*September 28th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' part ways with [[znxxX]]. <ref name="-znxxX">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-195113130_183|title=Принял решение покинуть состав академии Team Spirit|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Made a decision to leave the Team Spirit academy|date=2021-09-28|author=[[znxxX]]}}</ref>
*November 29th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' acquire [[ArtFr0st]] from [[Meta4Pro]]. <ref name="+ArtFr0st">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-69147006_8387|title=удачи в достижении новых высот|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=good luck in reaching new heights|date=2021-11-29|author=[[Meta4Pro]]}}</ref>
*December 28th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' sign [[donk]] and [[notineki]], move [[S0tF1k]] into a hybrid player/coach role, add [[KaiR0N-]] as an uncontracted stand-in, bench [[Patsi]] and [[s1ren]], and part ways with [[God6y]]. <ref name="AC WePlay S3"> {{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-32151480_404604|title=Team Spirit Academy врывается в бой!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Team Spirit Academy burst into battle!|date=2021-12-28|author=[[Team Spirit]]}}</ref><ref name="kairon no contract">{{inside source|source=KaiR0N-}}</ref>

|content3=
