* February 15th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' part ways with [[KaiR0N-]]. <ref name="-KaiR0N">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1493655923658797058|title=Changes in TS.Academy|date=2022-02-15|author=[[Team Spirit]]}}</ref>
* May 7th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' sign [[Qweall]] and [[H4SAN4TOR]] while moving [[S0tF1k]] to coach role only. <ref name="+Qweall +H4SAN4TOR">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-98674356_25293|title=Расскажу как дела у академки|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=I'll tell you how the academy is doing|date=2022-05-07|author=[[S0tF1k]]}}</ref>
* June 22nd - '''Team Spirit Academy''' part ways with [[Qweall]]. <ref name="-Qweall">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-185527044_564|title=it's me Vladislav "free agent" Pivkin|date=2022-06-22|author=[[Qweall]]}}</ref>
* July 8th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' sign [[OWNER]]. <ref name="+OWNER">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-98674356_25419|title=Всем хай, новости из стана TEAM SPIRIT ACADEMY|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Hi everyone, news from the camp of TEAM SPIRIT ACADEMY|date=2022-07-08|author=[[S0tF1k]]}}</ref>
* August 18th - '''Team Spirit Academy''' part ways with [[notineki]] and [[H4SAN4TOR]]. <ref name="-notineki">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/Team__Spirit/status/1560303278436540422|title=Denis "notineki" Kalachev and Vladislav "H4SAN4TOR" Tuchin are leaving our CS:GO academy|date=2022-08-18|author=[[Team Spirit]]'}}</ref>
